        "item_Dt637i": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>The shipping and delivery costs on our Website assume that you have provided us with accurate shipping and warranty details, accurate installation details, and you are able to receive the Product(s) within five (5) business days of our shipper attempting to contact you on your 'primary phone number' and 'alt phone number' on file.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_KN3Xf6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>The following actions and situations based on certain later conduct of a consumer may incur additional shipping and delivery costs:</p>",
            "sub_items": "<p>Making an appointment for delivery and waiting until the truck is loaded to cancel, or failing to cancel;<br/></p><p>Making a delivery appointment and being late for delivery, causing the shipper to have to wait and accumulate idle time;<br/></p><p>Not being able to receive the equipment within five (5) business days of the shipper attempting to make contact, leading to storage fees, which can be substantial; and/or<br/></p><p>Providing inaccurate house measurements, or inaccurate information about delivery requirements, or insufficient information that leads to a failed delivery, or extra time spent on site.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_f4zJdM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>If you cause additional shipping and delivery costs due to your later behaviors described above, we reserve the right to assess the additional costs incurred, and you agree to be responsible for such costs.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
