          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>The following actions and situations based on certain later conduct of a consumer may incur additional warranty costs:</p>",
            "sub_items": "<p>Making an appointment for a service call and waiting until the service provider is in transit to cancel, or not canceling at all;<br/></p><p>Mislocating parts sent, or any situation that requires the service provider to incur additional time and/or trip;<br/></p><p>Not being on site or not being able to allow the service provider to work on the equipment when the provider shows up for an appointment, causing the service provider to accumulate idle time;<br/></p><p>Providing inaccurate address info, causing the reshipment of parts; and/or<br/></p><p>Losing parts, or not sending parts back when asked to do so.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_GBMDfn": {
