            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>Use any portion of the Website for uploading, posting, e-mailing, transmitting, or otherwise making available User Content that is harmful to minors in any way, harassing, harmful, threatening, abusive, vulgar, obscene, defamatory, libelous, hateful, or racially, ethnically, or otherwise objectionable.</p>",
