        "item_PNKABR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You warrant and represent that you have the right and authority to use the credit card or payment method you have provided.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_N7zmYR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You give us and the Payment Method the pre-authorization to verify if your credit card or payment method account is valid and has the necessary funds or credit available to cover your payments.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_xfjktD": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You authorize such credit card or payment method to pay any amount described herein.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_T4e3nK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You confirm that your credited card or payment method has sufficient funds, credit facilities and valid expiry date to cover the payment.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_bCUWg3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You will receive an electronic invoice for your payments. This electronic invoice shall serve as your official receipt.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_C3wmX3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>In case of payment delay, you will not be able to use any chargeable features of our Website or Service until the payment in due has been fully paid.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_qr8YrC": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>Upon delay with any payments, you may be required to pay interest on the delay (penalty for late payment) for the period as of the time the payment obligation falls due until conforming performance is rendered. We reserve the right to assess reasonable interest charges on any amounts not paid by the date such payments are due.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_yGMxBK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>You are solely responsible for any and all fees charged to your credit card or payment method by the issuer, bank, or financial institution including, but not limited to, subscription, overdraft, insufficient funds, and over the credit limit fees.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_EHXj3n": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>All orders are subject to our credit approval. We reserve the right to withhold shipment or to require other adequate assurances of performance of your payment obligations as we, in our discretion, may require, notwithstanding any order confirmation issued by us.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_4TYNWJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>All payments shall be paid in US Dollars. You may have to incur costs for conversion and transfer of money if applied by your financial service provider.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
          }
        },
        "item_GmTtJK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>Other payment methods are accepted only if provided on our Website.</p>",
            "sub_items": ""
