            "text": "<p>We may terminate this Agreement:</p>",
            "sub_items": "<p>for any or no reason during any free use of the Website;</p><p>if you breach any of the terms of this Agreement, and that breach is not remediable;</p><p>if you breach any of the terms of this Agreement and that breach is not remedied within 15 days of you receiving written notice of the breach.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_g7YgeU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "text_without_number": "",
            "text": "<p>We may also block your access to our Website in the event that:</p>",
            "sub_items": "<p>You breach this Agreement;</p><p>we are unable to verify or authenticate any information you provide to us; or</p><p>we believe that your actions may cause financial loss or legal liability for you, our users or us.</p>"
